# MIDNIGHT / SIGNAL

Salon-X has one permanent design system. Read `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` before changing UI.

- Dark-first canvas `#0B0D12`, surfaces `#141821` / `#1D2230`, text `#F5F7FA` / `#9EA6B5`.
- Single accent `#7C82FF` (soft `#A8ACFF`). Do not purple entire screens.
- Semantic `#5DC08B` / `#FFB020` / `#EF7777` only for success / warning / danger.
- Font is Inter. 8px spacing. Radius 14px default, pills only for badges.
- Primary button: bg `#7C82FF`, text `#0B0D12`.
- Logo: `frontend/public/logo.png` via `BrandLogo`. Never recolor, stretch, or restyle.
- Use CSS variables / `tokens.ts`. Do not introduce a second component kit, gradients, glass, neon, or a new palette.

New entities reuse card, badge, table, form, modal, and nav patterns already in the system.
